 4 ~ // /// Working-space primaries and whitepoint for the colour spaces the preview
 5 ~ // /// pipeline uses. In darktable these come from the ICC profile (`profile->*`),
 6 ~ // /// but C41's pipeline only ever works in linear Rec.2020 (raws) or linear sRGB
 7 ~ // /// (non-raws), so the standard xy chromaticities are hardcoded here.
